OL,3,GNEWSANudist loses appeal after naked
OL,4,Aarrest by policeman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nudist who was arrested after walking
OL,7,Fnaked past an off-duty police officer
OL,8,Fhas had an appeal dismissed at the High
OL,9,FCourt.
OL,11,FNeil Cox wore nothing but a small bag
OL,12,Fover his shoulder, in which he carried
OL,13,Fa copy of the naturism guidance from
OL,14,Fthe College of Policing and his mobile
OL,15,Fphone.
OL,17,FTwo women had been left "confused and
OL,18,Fscared" after seeing the naked walker,
OL,19,Fa court heard.
