OL,5,
OL,6,FCox was convicted of disorderly or
OL,7,Fthreatening behaviour and fined #800
OL,8,Ffollowing the incident near
OL,9,FMacclesfield, Cheshire, on 22 August
OL,10,F2023. His second appeal has now been
OL,11,Frejected.
